- `RegulationID = 14` in mẫu: `Report/StudentManager/Learning/Leaning_BangDiemHocTapHK_QC14.repx`
- `RegulationID = 40`, `46`, `22` in mẫu: `Report/StudentManager/Learning/Leaning_BangDiemHocTapHK_QC22.repx`
